    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(Prerequisite: Ravenloft Campaign)</em></p><p>Deathly power dwells within you and bursts out at the slightest provocation. You gain the following features.</p><p><strong>Death Touch.</strong> You learn the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplChillTouch]{Chill Touch} cantrip, and you can cast it without components. The Necrotic damage you deal with it ignores Resistance. Your spellcasting ability for this spell is Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma (chosen when you take this feat).</p><p><strong>Pull of the Grave.</strong> You have Disadvantage on Death Saving Throws.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-TrcDGC4ufG208pgr\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Chill Touch is added by the feat; ignore the target's Resistance to its Necrotic damage yourself. The effect <em>Pull of the Grave</em> gives the Disadvantage on Death Saving Throws.</p></section>",
